Package: xios-core
Name: Xios Desktop Core
Version: 0.1.2
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: Max Leiter <maxwell.leiter@gmail.com>
Author: Max Leiter <maxwell.leiter@gmail.com>
Section: Desktop
Priority: optional
Depends: firmware (>= 16.0), com.max.xios (>= 0.1.1), iosc (>= 0.9.27), iosc-shell (>= 0.9.11), angle (>= 2.1.0+git20260630.a32d31d+es3-10), dbus, xios-desktop-defaults, xios-audio-server, xios-session (>= 1.0.56), xios-launcher-tools (>= 0.1.3)
Recommends: pulseaudio, xios-desktop-theme
MinimumOSVersion: 16.0.0
Description: shared base for every Xios desktop flavor
 The common foundation that every Xios desktop flavor builds on: the iosc
 Wayland compositor, the ANGLE GPU stack (OpenGL ES on Metal), the D-Bus
 message bus, desktop audio, and the ambient distro defaults (fonts, locale,
 XDG paths, retina display profile).
 .
 Install one of the flavor packages instead of this one: xios-gnome,
 xios-kde, xios-native, or xios-x11. Each pulls in xios-core automatically.
 .
 The Xios display app itself is sideloaded and is not part of this repo;
 xios-core provides everything that runs behind it. Target profile:
 @REPO_PROFILE@.
